d recording**\n\n✅ **Confirmed.**\n\n- The camera is consistently positioned at or near the vlogger’s eye level, angled slightly downward or straight ahead — consistent with holding a phone at arm’s length.\n- In **Frames 1–11**, the perspective is clearly from the vlogger’s point of view — he is centered in the frame, and the background moves past him as he walks.\n- In **Frame 12**, he holds the phone near his face — the angle suggests he is looking at the screen while recording.\n- In **Frames 23–30**, the camera is close to his face, and he gestures toward it — reinforcing the selfie-style, first-person perspective.\n- The framing often includes his hand or arm (e.g., **Frame 1, 3, 18, 20, 25, 28**) — a hallmark of self-recorded, handheld footage.\n\n---\n\n**Conclusion:**\n\nAll six criteria are **confirmed** across the 30 frames. The vlogger is consistently holding the phone directly in his hand, with no external devices (selfie stick, tripod) or second person involved. The camera movement and perspective are entirely consistent with first-person, handheld recording. This strongly supports the interpretation that the video is a self-recorded travel vlog shot using a smartphone held by the vlogger himself."}, {'batch_start': 30, 'batch_end': 44, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Mcggugol2ts/frames/frame_0726.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Mcggugol2ts/frames/frame_0727.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Mcggugol2ts/frames/frame_0728.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Mcggugol2ts/frames/frame_1479.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Mcggugol2ts/frames/frame_1480.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Mcggugol2ts/frames/frame_1481.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Mcggugol2ts/frames/frame_1482.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Mcggugol2ts/frames/frame_1483.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Mcggugol2ts/frames/frame_1484.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos